# Variant fw202312 of boards/hy300-2023: the second owner's unit (issue #11, GitHub `Souks`, 11.11.2026): boot
# package of 2023-12 (U-Boot 2018.05-00017-g1e43c6c of 2023-12-08, ARISC 2023-12-27, its own device tree 68011339...),
# the "ADT-3 2024-09" display.bin (the LOSEI X9's, issue #3) and the T08 family's database.TSE, under the 2023-12-27
# Android 11 userland. DRAM block and partition table are fw202306's. Read after ../../board.env; a key here wins.
VARIANT=fw202312
# nothing of ours has booted on it: TEST images only. The v0.97-beta HY300PRO-G-EU installer U-Boot (636 MHz) trained
# its DRAM over FEL (his read). The owner has a full dump (dump --full), ADB, no serial console.
STATUS=profile-only
VERIFIED_BY=
IMAGE_NAME=h713-hy300-2023-fw202312
# the clock of his boot0 at LBA 16 (fw202306's block, word for word)
DRAM_CLK=792
